WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.030
In Niger, about 73 percent of
workers were in agriculture in 2025.

2
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.830
In the USA, the figure
was about 1.5 percent.

3
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:15.290
Most American workers, 79.6
percent, were in services:

4
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:18.050
offices, stores, hospitals.

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.790
Why would one country's
workers mostly farm,

6
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.870
while the other's mostly serve?

7
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.250
In this mission, you'll
sort jobs into five sectors,

8
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.710
from farming and mining
to the very top decisions.

9
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.230
Then you'll read real job
data, country by country,

10
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.010
and look for the pattern.

11
00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.870
Your mission: explain why
most workers in Niger farm,

12
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.480
while most in the USA work in services.
